  "name": "Summertime Nano/Microplankton Communities in the Eastern Bering Sea",
  "description": "Samples of nano/microplankton abundance will be taken at six depths (surface, mixed layer, chlorophyll max, pycnocline and two deep samples) to characterize the water column and obtain integrated biomass. An NPMR project\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Data supporting NPMR project \"Summertime Nutrient Properties Related to Plankton Blooms in the Eastern Bering Sea\"",
